+inferred: rung 3 is dispatched only when rungs 1 **and** 2 both failed. The dispatched
+sequence spans two models in **2.7542%** of routed criticals under the Exp-42 first-pass
+rates `bench/routing.py` quotes, and **0.7857%** under the Exp-42 residual rates it was
+validated on (rung 1 resolved 6 of 7, rung 2 the remaining 1 of 1). Confirmed
+independently with Wolfram Language (local Wolfram Engine): 0.027541666666666662.
+
+This is the same execution semantics used to falsify the fable seat's seat remap, applied
